Package: blockr.input
Title: Interactive Data Entry Blocks for Blockr
Version: 0.0.0.9113
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Christoph",
           family = "Sax",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "christoph@cynkra.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7192-7044"))
Description: Extends 'blockr.core' with interactive blocks for end-user data
    entry. The edit block performs runtime CRUD over an upstream tibble,
    composing 'dplyr::rows_upsert' and 'dplyr::rows_delete' from form-style
    inputs. Designed to feed an applicant case into a workflow without the user
    writing R.
